      "widgets_values": [
        "# Linear Regression, From Scratch\n\nThis workflow trains **y = X·w + b** with mini-batch SGD exactly like the d2l textbook — and then **verifies** the learned `w` / `b` with the stateless `Linear Regression` + `Squared Loss` nodes. All data is generated inside the graph: no files, no downloads. Press **Queue** to run — the loss curve renders in the Plot node and its Preview Image below."
